{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/7bb1afa9b3fe61a4d92c7d41ab012307.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumbly is a fast-paced roguelike that rewards precision, rhythm, and instinct. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm, reflex, and instinct are your greatest weapons. Time your attacks, master enemy patterns, and unleash the power of a true feathery fighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/8d582f5c2b2c6464a16a9fb5e732ad27.avif?t=1750259695\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras_big/8d582f5c2b2c6464a16a9fb5e732ad27.avif?t=1750259695 width=800 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster and more precisely you act, the more <strong>devastating your combos</strong> become. Every turn is a chance to prove your reflexes \u2014 or fall flat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the right buttons to attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks for <strong>extra damage and fever bonus</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fever Mode</strong> boosts your damage and pauses the countdown timer!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/8e079903fa26c0306d7b08b3bb14a69d.poster.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/8e079903fa26c0306d7b08b3bb14a69d.webm?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/8e079903fa26c0306d7b08b3bb14a69d.mp4?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/83cc7fb2f4922dcc6954a29144cb6e1c.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read enemy patterns, dodge in rhythm, and adapt your tactics. From swarms of bats to sentinels, each enemy attacks differently \u2014 and expects you to keep up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills to dodge the attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied attack patterns keep battles exciting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/13191bf7fbb1271574b17c524c615122.poster.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/13191bf7fbb1271574b17c524c615122.webm?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/13191bf7fbb1271574b17c524c615122.mp4?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/4e68b606f3591bad47e59216a87f8a0a.poster.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/4e68b606f3591bad47e59216a87f8a0a.webm?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/4e68b606f3591bad47e59216a87f8a0a.mp4?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/f36e406279b9b5d35ed038213886e5d0.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock flashy, high-impact skills and combine them with <strong>Blessings</strong> that change the rules of battle each run. Build powerful synergies or gamble on chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 3 floors, you'll receive a <strong>Blessing Buff</strong> that makes you stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Blessing buff comes with its own set condition bonus, allowing you to customize your build freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression ensures a dynamic and  replay experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/eec75879fa7fc5e20e9cd2ae853774d9.poster.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/eec75879fa7fc5e20e9cd2ae853774d9.webm?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/eec75879fa7fc5e20e9cd2ae853774d9.mp4?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/c838aefe4e059af14897c1a2e6ecb551.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use earned currency to unlock permanent upgrades, new characters, or skills. Your climb gets better every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new characters and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are unlocked\u00a0by meeting special conditions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/e131caa3c46ca5b97170a9a42d2afcd8.poster.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/e131caa3c46ca5b97170a9a42d2afcd8.webm?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/e131caa3c46ca5b97170a9a42d2afcd8.mp4?t=1750259695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/d5c236f29d38393b295f81b634ae9da5.avif?t=1750259695\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight battles, satisfying progression, and cute-but-deadly bird warriors \u2014 <i>Rumbly</i> will keep you flapping \u2018til sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and join the fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/9c2fcb7a1438a0722b2a5e657ec7a502.avif?t=1750259695\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras_big/9c2fcb7a1438a0722b2a5e657ec7a502.avif?t=1750259695 width=800 height=302 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612210?t=1750259695","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/9c4cc1ac93